Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.52,0:00:07.07,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Y'know, maybe it would've been better \Nif you came down here later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.07,0:00:11.37,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I don't think there's anything to enjoy about \Ntouring a school you're not applyin' for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.37,0:00:13.10,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Well, you'd be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:15.88,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,So, you're going to take the exam \Nto get into a school down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.88,0:00:19.75,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Of course I am. It's lookin' pretty \Nlikely that I'll come back to Osaka, so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.02,0:00:23.10,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Huh. Did you just subtly reject me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:27.24,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Let's be real, I've been more or less\Nrejecting you this entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:28.97,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Never seems to sink in, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.73,0:00:32.13,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Oh, can I see your keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.13,0:00:33.00,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,My keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.69,0:00:35.75,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I made a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.75,0:00:38.91,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,The one from yesterday \Nwas basically ancient...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.91,0:00:41.27,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Kinda bums me out how much \Nmy skills have fallen off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.46,0:00:42.70,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Here, for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.94,0:00:49.10,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,We're almost there, so let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.99,0:02:23.49,sign_generic,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs18\an8\3c&HEAE9E5&\c&H2A2624&}I'd Rather You Hate Me than Not Care \NPart Two
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.33,0:02:23.50,Default,Seitoku Boy 1,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll see you all for \Ntomorrow's volunteering as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.97,0:02:25.99,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,I'm glad I was able to find this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.99,0:02:29.63,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,I'm no good with maps. \NIt's all thanks to you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.58,0:02:33.90,Default,Seitoku Boy 1,0,0,0,,If that's all you need, you can always ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.90,0:02:37.12,Default,Seitoku Boy 1,0,0,0,,And we can help with your thesis \Nresearch whenever. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.35,0:02:40.72,Default,Seitoku boy 2,0,0,0,,By the way, Nao, are you \Ncoming out for drinks today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.72,0:02:43.89,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Yeah. I plan to, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.17,0:02:49.39,Default,Seitoku Boy 2,0,0,0,,Well, Miku said something about you \Ncoming home late this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.74,0:02:52.72,Default,Seitoku Boy 2,0,0,0,,But it was probably for work, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.72,0:02:53.53,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.53,0:02:57.37,Default,Seitoku Boy 2,0,0,0,,Miku was talking about how she thought \Nyou had a guy here in Osaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.37,0:03:00.52,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Of course not. How could I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.79,0:03:03.03,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Well, I'll see you two tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.30,0:03:05.84,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,It's so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.84,0:03:10.41,italics,Nao,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna get serious about \Nsomeone as toxic as him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.58,0:03:17.79,italics,PA,0,0,0,,We are arriving at Fujito Women's \NCollege, Fujito Women's College.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.22,0:03:36.13,Default,High School Student 1,0,0,0,,Excuse me! You're Shiota Nao-chan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.59,0:03:38.11,Default,High School Student 1,0,0,0,,Whoa, it {\i1}is{\i0} you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.11,0:03:40.20,Default,High School 2,0,0,0,,Wow, she's so cute in person!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.20,0:03:42.80,Default,High School 2,0,0,0,,Would it be okay if we took a pic with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.19,0:03:44.98,Default,High School 2,0,0,0,,Thanks so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.98,0:03:45.94,Default,High School 2,0,0,0,,Can you believe it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.49,0:03:48.71,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Hey, excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.92,0:03:52.56,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Do you have a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.26,0:03:55.21,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.21,0:03:57.46,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Since those high schoolers \Nwere talking to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.46,0:03:59.99,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I thought you were going to college here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.99,0:04:03.98,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I've got a rotten sense of direction and \Ncouldn't find the student affairs office.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.34,0:04:07.96,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. I think it's \Nin the same direction I'm headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.12,0:04:13.49,italics,Nao,0,0,0,,I'm used to people looking at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.49,0:04:18.49,italics,Nao,0,0,0,,but she doesn't seem to care about how \Nshe shapes up compared to other girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.36,0:04:20.83,italics,Nao,0,0,0,,So nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.23,0:04:24.56,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Did you travel from far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.56,0:04:29.24,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm from Osaka, but \NI live in Tokyo at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:30.77,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.77,0:04:34.63,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,I came from Tokyo too, and I thought \NI had seen you somewhere before...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.63,0:04:36.79,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Maybe with someone I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.79,0:04:40.13,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You don't mean Miyama Kirishima, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.66,0:04:43.16,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Th-That's right, Miyama-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.16,0:04:46.06,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You seriously know Kirishima?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.06,0:04:48.41,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Well, just a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.76,0:04:52.90,italics,Nao,0,0,0,,She brings his name up that easily?\N How stupid is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:54.14,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Have you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.51,0:04:57.17,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Known Kirishima for long?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.17,0:05:00.77,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Oh, no, we're not that close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.77,0:05:03.49,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,But we attended the same grade school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.88,0:05:06.94,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,It was a private school called Minatohayama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.94,0:05:09.52,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,He already stood out way back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.02,0:05:14.11,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Does it have to do with his... \Nunique family circumstances?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.11,0:05:15.55,italics,Nao,0,0,0,,So, she knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.99,0:05:21.54,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,That was part of it, but Miyama-kun's \Nparents were normal people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.77,0:05:23.19,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,His parents?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.58,0:05:26.79,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, it's just... his \Nparents are still around?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:29.37,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,I think they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.37,0:05:32.62,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Since it was a private \Nschool, if they weren't...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.62,0:05:36.16,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Well, you know, I think there \Nwould have been rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:39.76,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I see. Actually, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:42.11,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,He's got parents like anyone else, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.11,0:05:45.07,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You seem to know a lot about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.30,0:05:49.08,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Oh no, Miyama-kun's just a bit famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.08,0:05:51.06,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,After... everything that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.33,0:05:54.64,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You mean that fight he got into?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.64,0:05:56.48,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Do you know the details about what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.48,0:05:58.57,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Not particularly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:06:03.62,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,But there was a famous karate \Ndojo near the grade school,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.62,0:06:06.10,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,and Miyama-kun was a student there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.10,0:06:08.72,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,But he got into a fight \Nwith some classmates...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.72,0:06:12.34,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,and injured them pretty badly, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.39,0:06:19.63,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,I think that's it. I \Nshould get going, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.20,0:06:22.54,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Oh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.54,0:06:25.01,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I really appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.01,0:06:28.81,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,It's okay. But if you could, don't \Nmention this to Miyama-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.81,0:06:31.50,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You bet! Thanks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.11,0:06:33.35,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Bye, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.35,0:06:34.63,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Actually, one other thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.99,0:06:37.64,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Do you mind if I ask one last thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.55,0:06:41.61,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Didn't think she'd actually \Ngive me her contact info.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.13,0:06:44.38,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,It's pretty clearly a \Nburner account, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:45.53,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.01,0:06:50.01,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Do you know a girl named Shiota Nao?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:51.71,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Nah. Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.71,0:06:56.40,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,She used to be on TV and \Nstuff. I ran into her...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.39,0:06:58.14,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\p1\fscy220\alpha&H20&\c&HFCFEFE&}m 0 0 l 200 0 200 53 0 53
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.39,0:06:58.14,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs12\bord0\pos(15,16)}Minatohayama Institute Grade School\N\N Founded in 1927.\N A unified school offering classes from\N preschool to college. Highly regarded \Nby households looking for an integrated\Neducation with a curriculum specializing \Nin helping to shape children to fit their\N future needs...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.40,0:06:58.15,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.32,0:07:01.98,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Nothing for you to worry about, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.98,0:07:06.49,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You realize we're always together in Tokyo, \Nright? And it's been the same as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.49,0:07:09.23,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,You're going to tour the college \Nagain tomorrow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.23,0:07:12.91,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,I'm gonna meet up with you in the \Nevening, since exams end tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.33,0:07:15.45,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,But that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.45,0:07:19.65,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Wait, you oughta be studying! \NAll you've been doing is snackin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.65,0:07:21.06,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,I'll do fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.06,0:07:22.53,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Like hell, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.28,0:07:27.99,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Oh, I was right about Kobe. Lucky me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.99,0:07:29.93,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I might have a knack for real estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.93,0:07:31.30,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:36.08,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You wanna come with? Doesn't seem \Nlike you're gonna be studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:37.30,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Where we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.01,0:07:38.82,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Kobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.06,0:07:45.81,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\b1\fs15\c&HFFF9DF&\frz11.19\move(324,220,329,204)}Somei Yoshino
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.58,0:07:48.99,italics,Nao,0,0,0,,She seems flashy on the surface, \Nbut empty on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.99,0:07:51.79,italics,Nao,0,0,0,,Kirishima-kun must have different \Ntaste in women now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.55,0:07:53.90,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Nao!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.05,0:07:56.66,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,You feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.23,0:08:00.32,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,No, I'm okay. Thanks for worrying, Ozu-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.32,0:08:03.22,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,You've been avoiding me lately, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.55,0:08:06.06,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Does it have to do with the rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:09.58,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,It's so messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:12.22,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,I mean, I did introduce her to those guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.22,0:08:15.59,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,but you know how it is with girls and rumors... \NIt turned into a whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.03,0:08:17.49,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,You can relate, right, Nao?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.09,0:08:21.10,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,You've been having guys help \Nyou with your thesis, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.71,0:08:24.60,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,I didn't really ask them to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:27.30,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,You never do, do you, Nao?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.30,0:08:31.10,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,But you still manage to control the guys \Nthat come around in spite of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.34,0:08:34.72,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,You can be kind of a creep, \Nsometimes, Ozu-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.72,0:08:38.98,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,We're not dating anymore, so I'd \Nappreciate it if you didn't bother me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.98,0:08:41.10,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Hey, it was praise!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.10,0:08:44.00,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,I make pretty good use of the girls \Nthat are interested in me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.27,0:08:48.33,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,I didn't think she would bring \Nthe cops into it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.33,0:08:52.51,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Throwing away a chance to milk those \Nguys for cash. Can you imagine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.12,0:08:54.76,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.76,0:08:56.84,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,You heard the rumors, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.84,0:09:01.25,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,About me forcing girls from the \Nagency to meet with guys I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.25,0:09:02.95,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,It's the other way around, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.95,0:09:06.33,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,I've been introducing wannabe actresses and \Nmodels who don't have any real prospects
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.33,0:09:09.26,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,to rich potential patrons and taking \Na fee for making the connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.51,0:09:14.89,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,If she had the guts to pull one \Nover on those rich idiots,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.89,0:09:18.29,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,she could've leeched off of \Nthem for the rest of her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.52,0:09:21.28,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,What? Why are you telling me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.44,0:09:26.79,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,You slept with Miyama Kirishima, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.73,0:09:31.56,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,What?! Do you have me confused with someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.56,0:09:33.90,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.90,0:09:38.06,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Most women wouldn't have the guts to risk their \Nbig newscaster job by going out with a yakuza.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.42,0:09:40.56,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, it wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.80,0:09:43.37,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,I've got pictures and video.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.87,0:09:47.59,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,And you smoked marijuana while \Nyou were in America, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.59,0:09:51.06,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,With a classmate from college, \Nin July, two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.06,0:09:53.82,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,I-I did no such thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.10,0:09:57.50,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,To be honest, it doesn't really \Nmatter if you did or didn't,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.50,0:09:59.50,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,or if you screwed that yakuza.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.50,0:10:02.46,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,I can make it sound like you did \Njust because you were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.39,0:10:05.45,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.45,0:10:10.27,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're fast to catch on! \NYou always were clever, Nao.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.86,0:10:16.34,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, I want you to bring Miyama \NKirishima to a specific location.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.35,0:10:19.82,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,But don't let him realize what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.82,0:10:23.48,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Make sure that yakuza's granddaughter \Nhe hangs out with is there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.48,0:10:26.07,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,You do that, and I'll make \Nall of this go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.07,0:10:27.97,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,I have no idea who you're talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.97,0:10:30.69,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,She's the granddaughter of \Na Kirigayama-gumi big shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.69,0:10:34.98,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,I think it's the Somei boss. \NI believe her name is Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.46,0:10:41.73,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,If you're feeling guilty about \Nselling your boy out, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.09,0:10:48.40,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Miyama Kirishima himself was the one who \Nspread the rumors about you and him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.25,0:10:52.14,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,He sold you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.14,0:10:55.54,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,At this point, regrets aren't \Ngonna get you anywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.54,0:10:57.14,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,so I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.33,0:11:05.76,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Did you know that Mount Tenpo over \Nthere is only five meters tall?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.73,0:11:10.01,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,For real?! And I was psyched \Nabout telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.72,0:11:14.33,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I thought you were going to \Ntour the campus again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.33,0:11:17.23,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I figured it'd be fine to skip a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.82,0:11:20.49,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,"Aquatic life showcase"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.49,0:11:22.26,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,It's an aquarium.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.19,0:11:25.36,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Huh, it's like we're on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.36,0:11:27.24,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I can see the resemblance, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.93,0:11:30.70,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,That'd be fine, though. An aquarium date.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.99,0:11:35.51,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,That said... probably shouldn't have \Ncome here during summer vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.51,0:11:39.26,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Should we hold hands to keep from getting \Nseparated? Since it's a date and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:43.28,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Please, no. I only said \Nthat I saw a resemblance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.29,0:11:45.51,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I guess that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:52.72,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Did you come here often?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.72,0:11:55.53,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,This place is sorta the local aquarium.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.84,0:12:00.93,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I used to think all of them were called \Naquatic life showcases until I was in second grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.24,0:12:03.67,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,That's adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.03,0:12:06.81,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,That's just how it goes when you're a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.35,0:12:08.70,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.01,0:12:11.01,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I don't remember anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.82,0:12:16.21,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What, like you don't remember your \Nchildhood? Some kinda amnesia?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.21,0:12:18.16,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Don't be silly. I remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.16,0:12:22.15,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,But there isn't anything entertaining \Nenough to tell you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.15,0:12:24.47,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,So, tell me something \Nthat isn't entertaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.78,0:12:28.86,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Stuff like food or hobbies... \Nor your birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.86,0:12:31.19,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Are you seriously interested in that stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.48,0:12:33.82,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,If you don't wanna talk \Nabout it, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.82,0:12:36.24,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I never \Ntold you my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:37.57,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,April 2nd.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.57,0:12:39.74,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,That was so fast it was creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.74,0:12:44.57,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,As for favorite foods, I'd say \NWakayama ramen, sanuki udon,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.57,0:12:46.89,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,mitarashi dango, and sakura mochi...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.89,0:12:49.74,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,And most things with sweet cream on 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.74,0:12:52.86,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Don't really have a lot of \Nhobbies, but I do like driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.86,0:12:54.22,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Great for blowing off steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.22,0:12:56.39,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You have a license?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.39,0:12:58.51,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Huh, so you {\i1}don't{\i0} know everything about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.51,0:13:02.36,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I knew that you got a learner's\Npermit during spring break.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:03.76,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Okay, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.76,0:13:08.25,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I should probably get my license too. \NBut it's not gonna be for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.51,0:13:10.86,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Since my birthday's not for four months.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.86,0:13:14.06,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Four months? So you were born in November?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.06,0:13:15.78,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.01,0:13:19.92,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I dunno why, but I can't help but be \Nsuspicious about everything you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.92,0:13:22.93,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I guess that makes you a \NScorpio? Or a Sagittarius?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.36,0:13:24.61,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Well, which is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.61,0:13:26.00,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,A Scorpio, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.00,0:13:30.60,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Seriously? I'm an Aries, they're supposed \Nto be a terrible match for Scorpios.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:33.83,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Really? What would be a good match?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.83,0:13:35.03,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Gemini, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.23,0:13:38.11,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Okay, in that case, my birthday is in June.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.11,0:13:39.28,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,How's that supposed to work?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.04,0:13:42.79,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry. It really is in November.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.78,0:13:48.29,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,I'll take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.29,0:13:50.04,Default,Seitoku Girl 4,0,0,0,,Thanks, Ozu-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.04,0:13:52.56,Default,Seitoku Girl 1,0,0,0,,Wait, Shiota Nao didn't show?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.86,0:13:54.77,Default,Male Student A,0,0,0,,She supposedly isn't feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.77,0:13:56.53,Default,Seitoku Girl 3,0,0,0,,Seriously? That's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.53,0:13:59.05,Default,Seitoku Girl 3,0,0,0,,Why'd that chick even come to Osaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.24,0:14:01.08,Default,Seitoku Girl 2,0,0,0,,Come on, that's going overboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.00,0:14:08.76,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Do you like sharks?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.76,0:14:13.07,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Grandpa wants me to send \Nhim pics whenever I go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.21,0:14:23.45,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Am I in the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.45,0:14:24.85,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Nah, it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.85,0:14:27.96,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,S-Scary... does this dude have \Neyes in the back of his head?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.79,0:14:31.63,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,When did you first get a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.28,0:14:34.35,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Just asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.62,0:14:36.62,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Either sixth grade or the \Nfirst year of middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.62,0:14:39.88,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,But she was more like a \Npatron than a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.93,0:14:42.82,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I had an arrangement with the boss
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.82,0:14:46.19,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,where he only gave me a certain \Namount of money to cover my food.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.19,0:14:48.70,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Which meant I usually didn't eat my fill,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.70,0:14:51.29,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,so until the second year of middle school,\NI'd look for people with money...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.29,0:14:52.70,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Dude, you were a gigolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.70,0:14:58.12,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I was. But I really never dated a girl \Nfrom the same class or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.42,0:15:00.99,flashback,Nao,0,0,0,,We attended the same grade school.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.55,0:15:04.01,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,He didn't say anything about \Nthe same school, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.01,0:15:06.22,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You're asking a lot of questions today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.22,0:15:10.50,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Hobbies, favorite foods... It's like \Na meeting for an arranged marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.79,0:15:13.27,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I mean, that's kinda why I was askin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.76,0:15:17.10,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Those kinda things are normal \Nto ask first, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.10,0:15:19.78,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,It's honestly weird that we skipped them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.05,0:15:22.17,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I absolutely don't plan on marrying you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.17,0:15:25.28,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,but it wouldn't be fair to \Njust stay ignorant, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.51,0:15:27.42,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I don't care anymore, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.42,0:15:31.59,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You might not lie, but you're \Nnot exactly honest, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.59,0:15:33.78,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Although that does fit \Nwhat I {\i1}do{\i0} know about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.78,0:15:37.88,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Let's just wait out the remaining \Neight months, doing what we're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.31,0:15:44.54,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.67,0:15:50.79,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.29,0:15:56.38,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.37,0:16:05.69,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Sorry. I should have put it on silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.69,0:16:07.44,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Would you mind waiting here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.85,0:16:12.71,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Sudden business, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.71,0:16:15.19,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Yeah. Something came up, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.42,0:16:17.58,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,How about you come straight home, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:19.20,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,What sudden business?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.20,0:16:21.12,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Considerin' he's in Osaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.12,0:16:22.70,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,No clue...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.34,0:16:27.83,italics,Shoma,0,0,0,,You want me to stake out the apartment \Nbuilding? I'm closer to Kobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:30.21,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fs15\c&H505447&\frx18\fry5\frz17.63\move(399,205,399,202)}One new message
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.45,0:16:32.46,italics,Shoma,0,0,0,,Yoshino-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.83,0:16:34.68,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Nah. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:38.47,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I started this, so I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.47,0:16:40.71,italics,Shoma,0,0,0,,Is this what I think it is? Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.02,0:16:42.91,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Why, you got a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.91,0:16:44.80,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Nothin' but problems, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.80,0:16:46.97,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Why do you even care what his deal is?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.18,0:16:51.57,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,If he dies, he's got it comin', \Nso just let him bite it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.57,0:16:53.71,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,That's awful kind of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.71,0:16:57.49,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,"Kind"? You sure you're not the one \Ngettin' attached, Yoshino-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.49,0:17:02.12,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid. I could give a rat's \Nass about what he does and with who.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.12,0:17:07.24,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,The thing is... before this wraps up, \NI've gotta kick his ass a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.24,0:17:10.33,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,If he's gonna die, it's gotta be after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.33,0:17:14.26,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I play nice for a little while and \Neveryone thinks they can clown on me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.15,0:17:16.58,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'll talk to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.58,0:17:17.44,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Yoshino-sa—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.55,0:17:24.38,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Makeup time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.95,0:17:28.83,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You seem down today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.39,0:17:31.40,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,No. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.96,0:17:36.99,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I know you were busy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.99,0:17:39.51,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,It's fine. You're more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.77,0:17:44.67,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,More than her? Somei Yoshino?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.67,0:17:48.42,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,I ran into her yesterday at Fujito Women's U.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.82,0:17:49.96,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.27,0:17:52.92,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,No, I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.67,0:17:59.39,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you to trade \Ncontact info, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.39,0:18:03.12,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You actually gave her yours? Did you \Nthink it'd come in handy some day?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.12,0:18:04.73,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,How do you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.12,0:18:07.44,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Did you arrange for us to meet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.44,0:18:12.87,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,No. But I did anticipate that \Nyou might run into each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.87,0:18:16.85,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Although ideally, you would've \Nseen the two of us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.14,0:18:22.68,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You heard from Ozu Kento, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.68,0:18:25.29,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I was relieved when you contacted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.29,0:18:27.34,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,This would've been a huge waste
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.34,0:18:30.84,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,if you had gotten attached \Nenough to me to turn him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.84,0:18:34.20,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,But when you're selling out a \Nscumbag, there's no guilt, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:38.46,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Wait... did you let me see \Nthat picture on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.81,0:18:41.23,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I figured you would look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.64,0:18:45.47,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Sending a message to myself \Nended up paying off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.68,0:18:50.08,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Unbelievable... You're all such \Nscum, I wish you'd just die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.08,0:18:52.24,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Those rumors about you \Nwere true, weren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:53.22,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,What rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.67,0:18:57.48,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,That girl at the agency who went \Ninto porn before disappearing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.48,0:18:59.24,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,and how you were involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.49,0:19:01.03,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Oh, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.03,0:19:04.56,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,You and Ozu will do anything \Nfor money, won't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.56,0:19:06.26,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,You're probably working together!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.00,0:19:10.74,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You really ended up being the \Nperfect mark for Ozu-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:17.35,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,It's true that I told him we were \Ngoing out, albeit indirectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.75,0:19:20.86,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,And I did know the girl you mentioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.86,0:19:25.26,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,But Ozu-kun was the one involved \Nin her disappearance, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.87,0:19:29.51,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Being surrounded by worthless \Npeople can wear anyone out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.04,0:19:32.94,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Her depression had gotten particularly bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:36.94,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,and she mentioned going home to see \Nher parents three months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.69,0:19:43.52,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,But she told me a month later how she was \Nexcited to be working for a new agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.52,0:19:46.70,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I tried to convince her \Nto work somewhere else,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.70,0:19:49.87,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,but never managed get a hold \Nof her... Then came the porn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.87,0:19:51.33,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,And then the disappearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.33,0:19:54.30,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,And you're saying Ozu Kento was responsible?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.60,0:20:00.06,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,The same thing has happened to three \Ngirls I know in the last few months.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.89,0:20:02.92,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You're the fourth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.04,0:20:06.67,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,What did Ozu-kun say to \Nget you to come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.70,0:20:11.22,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,That he'd get rid of the evidence \Nof us being together
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.22,0:20:13.44,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,if I bring you to a specific location...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.69,0:20:15.08,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Anything about marijuana?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.61,0:20:19.43,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Then he would've been able to blackmail \Nyou, even if I wasn't involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.43,0:20:21.57,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,He was after you all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.09,0:20:25.81,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,He'd been getting on my nerves \Nlately, but that was just because
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.81,0:20:29.95,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,his backers happened to share that \Nparticular interest with him...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.37,0:20:35.83,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,They're using Ozu, and he's using you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.04,0:20:40.29,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You're gonna be his bitch for the \Nrest of your life, at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.29,0:20:42.16,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Then what am I supposed to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.16,0:20:46.46,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,This only happened because \Nyou used me to lure him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.69,0:20:50.72,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,It would've been even worse for \Nyou if I hadn't, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.72,0:20:52.47,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Besides, it goes both ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.48,0:20:57.76,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I was dating you in order to establish \Nconnections with the people you knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.76,0:21:00.59,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,And you wanted me for my connections,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.59,0:21:03.48,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,as well as the convenient violence \Nthat the yakuza offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.26,0:21:08.86,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,So, let's get going. Where \Ndid Ozu-kun want to meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.71,0:21:12.00,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,What about that Yoshino girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:14.25,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,She's already headed there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.53,0:21:16.02,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:19.21,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,The deal was for me to bring her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.21,0:21:22.51,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,I contacted her already, saying \NI had something to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.74,0:21:25.50,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.77,0:21:28.19,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,I did! I can show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.19,0:21:33.34,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I've got a copy of her phone, \Nso I can tell when she gets a text.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.34,0:21:36.77,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,I sent the text to a tablet, not a phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.12,0:21:39.02,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,She asked me specifically \Nto contact her through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.29,0:21:42.52,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,She sent the friend request \Nto me yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.51,0:21:51.52,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Hey, Kirishima?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.88,0:21:53.91,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,What are you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.91,0:21:58.16,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Look, just listen. \NYou're with Shiota Nao, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.66,0:22:02.02,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Ozu Kento isn't at the location \Nshe wanted me to go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.02,0:22:03.16,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.91,0:22:04.91,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Because right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.66,0:22:08.66,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm looking at him.
